  "slots": "Slot 1 is the subject: what the page is about. Slot 2 is the adjacent thing someone reading it would also buy - never a repeat of slot 1. Slots 3 and 4 are anchors: named high-value products drawn from the pool named in anchorGroup, which is where the basket value is. A page never shows the same query twice. An article may also name slot3 or slot4 explicitly to override the anchor pool.",
